# Cursor Rules for Logika (Mastermind PWA)
# Refer to AGENTS.md for full codebase invariants.

- Always run `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, and `npm test` after modifying code.
- Never add vertical scrollbars to the game board; layout must strictly conform to `100dvh`.
- Keep `src/core/` pure without DOM or UI imports.
- Keep the Knuth solver off-thread in `src/solver/solver.worker.ts`.
- Slot popover must always position downward (`popover-down`).
- Any new translation key in `src/i18n/ru.ts` must be mirrored in `src/i18n/en.ts`.
